# Git Submodules

This project uses Git submodules:
- `submodules/mcp-abap-adt/` - MCP server for ABAP ADT (has its own `.cursor/rules/`)
- `submodules/llm-agent/` - LLM agent orchestrator (has its own `.cursor/rules/`)

**Important:**
- Submodules have their own `.cursor/rules/` directories
- When working in submodules, follow their specific rules
- Changes to submodules should be committed in the submodule repository first
- Main project references submodules via git submodule pointers
